        "postRandomization": {
          "schemeTwists": 6,
          "bystanders": {
            "addExtra": 4
          },
          "notes": [
            "Deal the shuffled Villain Deck into several \"Dimension\" decks where the first Dimension has 1 card, the next has 2 cards, then 3, 4, etc. (The final Dimension might not have enough cards to reach its full number.)"
